1
00:00:02,040 --> 00:00:18,170
On a liaison mission, Vu A Dinh fell into the enemy's guerrilla encirclement.

2
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:31,750
The West team soldier interrogated, beat, threatened A Dinh, forcing him to reveal the location of our cadres.

3
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:47,310
Beaten from early morning until noon, until late afternoon, but A Dinh only answered: "I don't know!".

4
00:00:48,240 --> 00:00:54,130
A Dinh gritted his teeth, tears welled in his eyes.

5
00:00:55,130 --> 00:01:03,800
No matter how the enemy quarreled and questioned, A Dinh said nothing more.

6
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:18,370
All that night, the West team made A Dinh lie outside in the cold wind, freezing dew.

7
00:01:19,730 --> 00:01:28,190
A Dinh was seriously injured but his face still shone.

8
00:01:30,220 --> 00:01:43,130
He kept our cadres on the mountain safe.

